<title>UK: Laird says yr pretax profit slightly up.</title>
<headline>Laird says yr pretax profit slightly up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  35.0		 vs   33.9</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   13.0		 vs   12.0</p>
<p> Pretax			 69.2		 vs   67.2</p>
<p> Turnover		    973.9		 vs  854.8*</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are based on the continuing operations of the company.</p>
<p>*The company's turnover including discontinued operations showed 992.6 million stg.</p>
<p>Analysts expected the pretax profit to range between 66 and 67 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Laird Group Plc</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
